SUMMARY:☀️ 12WY Mission + Today's #1 Action
DESCRIPTION:MY MISSION (edit me):\n"I run my businesses on purpose\, not by accident. Consistent action — not perfect ideas — builds TMES\, CN Capital\, and Star Gazer. I do the work I can control every day\, and I score it every Monday. By August 23 I will have proof\, not excuses."\n\nBefore anything else: name your ONE most important action today. Do it first.
